  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Three engine fixes, no API changes. Deeply-recursive stylesheets now raise a catchable XTDE0000 instead of overflowing the native stack and aborting the host process. key() now matches attribute/text use-values (xs:untypedAtomic) against string lookup keys, so keys defined with use=\"@attr\" resolve. parse-json of a top-level JSON array yields array(*) rather than a flattened sequence, and indent=\"yes\" applies to output built from a JSON/map initial context item (Martin Honnen). See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
